55777,-0.08245457708835602,0.016906509175896645,-0.08863160759210587,0.033893927931785583,0.04167444258928299,0.062068939208984375,-0.04282568395137787,-0.013683279044926167],"environment_constraints":{"dependencies":{},"markers":{"memory_write_only":"true","retrieval_performed":"false"},"runtime":"docker","versions":{"python":"3.12.1"}},"evidence_count":1,"evidence_summary":"Running pytest produced exit code 1 due to a ValueError in the Icelandic locale for future time deltas. After editing the locale file to adjust the delta check and add handling for non‑zero deltas, the subsequent test run completed with exit code 0.","guidance":"When a test failure indicates a locale incorrectly raises an error for positive deltas, locate the locale\u0027s delta handling code. Change the condition that raises the error to apply only to zero deltas, and add a fallback for other delta values (positive or negative) to select the appropriate form.","id":"recovery-pattern-ad07a6a45718b848a30ad377","invalidated_at":null,"source_chronological_index":1,"source_failure_id":"f08263f0-bae8-5749-9ecf-6a2ec090a5f8","source_failure_type":"test_failure","source_operation":"run_command","source_outcome_id":"2f15f6e9-4c49-53bc-b6d3-2612a882d71c","source_resolution_id":"162c3161-3054-54b4-b439-3569ba9d45ba","source_task_id":"GS-T001","source_tool":"run_command","title":"Refine locale delta condition to limit error to zero deltas","trigger":{"failure_context":"frozen objective failed before agent execution","failure_signature":"run_command:exit_code=1","failure_type":"test_failure","source_action_arguments":{"command":["python","-m","pytest"]},"source_operation":"run_command","source_task_problem_statement":"Icelandic locale humanize raises ValueError for future time deltas\r\n\r\n#### Description\r\n\r\nWhen using the Icelandic locale to format future time deltas, a ValueError is raised instead of returning the proper future form. The error message indicates that zero deltas are not supported, but this occurs even for positive (future) deltas.\r\n\r\n#### Steps/Code to Reproduce\r\n\r\n```python\r\nimport arrow\r\n\r\n# Set locale to Icelandic\r\narrow.locales.IcelandicLocale()._format_timeframe(\u0027minutes\u0027, 2)\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis should return the future form \"2 mínútur\" but instead raises:\r\n\r\n```\r\nValueError: Icelandic Locale does not support units with a delta of zero. Please consider making a contribution to fix this issue.\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe issue affects all positive delta values when trying to format future timeframes in Icelandic locale. Past deltas (negative values) work correctly, and zero deltas are expected to raise this error, but positive deltas should return the future form instead of raising an exception.","source_tool":"run_command","version_sensitive":true},"verification_status":"observed_successful","embedding_dimension":384}
